"custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-21T23:40:03-07:00","id":955449,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3514\" data-vbnamecard=\"3514\">ZealousChristian24</a>, same thought I was having, also pointed before. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T00:23:08-07:00","id":955463,"title":"","content":"this is a glorious show for breaking in new players to the hisil.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-24T00:33:37-07:00","id":956837,"title":"","content":"I myself was thinking along the lines of a wound but I can see a host being a better idea","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5448-kavagja","name":"Kavagja","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T07:58:44-07:00","id":962285,"title":"","content":"I loved the depiction of the Upside Down. Right down to the toxic air environmental tilt. It sent me searching through the W:tF books for comparable crunch to add to the hisil. I'm currently utilizing two shoals, and one that is on the verge of becoming wound. I plan on adding a tilt for places where the gauntlet has become too thick as a result of Azlu or other forces. Here is what I have so far. Italics are the Hisil description of the same place.<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#232323\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">172 Shepard Avenue feels wrong, like the cardboard backdrop of the old hollywood movies. The place feels hollow, lifeless. You can see the grass beginning to die. The place is real to the touch, but it makes your spine stand on end. It is obvious you are not the only one that feels this way, because people tend to slow down walking past it.<br /> <br /> Tilt: Every point of Willpower spent only adds 1 additional die, and no willpower can be regained while in this place.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#232323\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Thick webs cover the structure, making it only barely visible through the gauzy white silk. The shape remains true though. The doors are two dark tunnels encircled by spider silk. You can see movement in the silk walls as you approach. Small black dots disappearing before you can get near.</span></i></span></span><br /> <br /> Tilt: While in 127 Shepard Avenue, all characters suffer the leg wrack tilt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Running: <a href=\"https://shield-bearers.obsidianportal.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Shield Bearers - W:TF 2nd</a><br /> Currently Planning: The Dead End Kids - CoD<br /> Untilted Tenra Bansho Zero game<br /> Currently Playing: <a href=\"http://theunusualsuspects.obsidianportal.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Unusual Suspects - D:td</a>, I am playing <a href=\"http://www.noordinaryobsession.com/2016/08/19/unusual-suspects-naturalist/\" target=\"_blank\">The Naturalist</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2293-salientmind","name":"salientmind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-01T16:33:36-07:00","id":1154878,"title":"","content":"Now with Season 2 I can clearly say that <b>Stranger Things</b> 2 sold to me idea of Idigam as <b>Werewolf: the Forsaken</b> 2E main antagonist! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div s